NAME
       uniq - report or omit repeated lines

SYNOPSIS
       uniq [-cdui] [-f N] [-s N] [INPUT [OUTPUT]]

DESCRIPTION
       Filter adjacent matching lines from INPUT, writing to OUTPUT. Sort the
       input first to find all duplicates.

OPTIONS
       -c
           prefix lines by the number of occurrences

       -d
           only print duplicate lines

       -u
           only print unique lines

       -i
           ignore case

       -f N
           skip the first N fields

       -s N
           skip the first N characters

EXAMPLES
       sort words | uniq -c | sort -rn | head

SEE ALSO
       sort(1)
